      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "c3d4620a-efc8-437a-a41d-646d6ee3d68e",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "78247aa2-5d7a-4921-aa4c-c59f24cdea65",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "d2f05817-bdda-488c-a7ac-3c4b3a58cf36",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "The first service\nplan has four\npressure units\navailable within\nthe",
                      "safe limit. The\nclinic needs two,\nthe depot needs\none, and the",
                      "foundry needs one.\nA decorative steam\narch would take\nanother two.",
                      "The arch is\noptional; the\nthree working\nstops are not. Pip\nadmits he",
                      "drew the arch\nbefore adding the\ndemand numbers.\nRivet hands him an",
                      "eraser without\ncommenting on its\nimpressive curve."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "9b982dc6-b4b8-45b2-a0b4-53bacb97d13a",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
